            <title>WN11-CC-000252 - Windows 11 must be configured to disable Windows Game Recording and Broadcasting.</title>
            <affected family="windows">
              <platform>Microsoft Windows 11</platform>
            </affected>
            <description>Windows Game Recording and Broadcasting is intended for use with games; however, it could record screenshots of other applications and expose sensitive data. Disabling the feature will prevent this from occurring.

Note: A different registry location is needed when systems are managed by Intune versus GPO.</description>
